{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122462","id":4289801058,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7_sSti","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122462","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122462.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122462.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122462","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122462/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122462/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122462/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/eee6b8a765eb8ed5afa8c4d5d5f9c4e9b61c56b2","number":122462,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Free reflection atlas color buffer and face views","user":{"login":"ravarcade","id":3882838,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODI4Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3882838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade","html_url":"https://github.com/ravarcade","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #122461.\r\n\r\n`LightStorage::_reflection_atlas_update()` allocates `color_buffer` — the\r\n`TEXTURE_TYPE_CUBE` a probe renders into before it is copied to the octmap — and\r\nsix slice views of it, but `_reflection_atlas_clear()` frees only `reflection`,\r\n`depth_fb` and `depth_buffer`. Neither field is passed to `free_rid()` anywhere\r\nelse in the engine, so both leak. Because `reflection_atlas_free()` also goes\r\nthrough `_reflection_atlas_clear()`, freeing the atlas outright does not release\r\nthem either: the seven RIDs survive the `Scenario` that owned them.\r\n\r\nThat makes it a growing leak rather than a shutdown artifact — 7 textures per\r\natlas the process has ever built:\r\n\r\n| situation | leaked at exit, before this PR |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| one probe, one world | 7 |\r\n| one probe, then switched to `UPDATE_ALWAYS` (rebuilds the atlas mid-run) | 14 |\r\n| four `World3D`s with a probe each, created and freed one at a time | 28 |\r\n\r\nThe framebuffers in `color_fbs` are freed here before their attachments, the way\r\n`depth_fb` already is, rather than left to dependency cleanup.\r\n\r\nThe fields were added in #107902 and were not added to the teardown path; 4.5 is\r\nunaffected, 4.6 onwards is.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\nBuilt from `master` (`00932449c9`) on Windows 11 / MSVC, Vulkan 1.4.349,\r\nAMD Radeon RX 7800 XT, with the MRP from the issue:\r\n\r\n| build | one probe | four worlds |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| master | `7 RIDs of type \"Texture\" were leaked` | `28 RIDs ... leaked` |\r\n| this PR | clean | clean |\r\n\r\nSame for Forward Mobile. Rendering is unaffected: screenshots of a mirrored\r\nsphere in a coloured room, taken by both builds — including after a mid-run\r\nswitch to `UPDATE_ALWAYS`, which exercises the changed code path while the game\r\nruns — are byte-identical (same SHA-256).","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-16T11:08:50Z","updated_at":"2026-08-17T09:19:03Z","closed_at":"2026-08-17T09:18:56Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1347bf4cc1fe44b44a6b0e8c65b98a44910db990","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"ravarcade:fix-reflection-atlas-rid-leak","ref":"fix-reflection-atlas-rid-leak","repo":{"id":1335836760,"node_id":"R_kgDOT59AWA","name":"godot","full_name":"ravarcade/godot","owner":{"login":"ravarcade","id":3882838,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODI4Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3882838?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade","html_url":"https://github.com/ravarcade","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ravarcade/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false